.SCREEN	76	Abandoned Laboratory

.MSG
You enter the structure. Twisted pipes and strange contraptions decorate
the stone walls. Suddenly, you hear a screeching noise. You hide.

A mysterious creature appears. As you try to scan it, all the energy
meters are peaked. All your visors show it as a white blob. Its energy
levels are impressive. It's something that, as a bio-reseracher, you've
never seen, nor thought was possible to exist. You record its behavior,
when a small frog like animal closes by, the creature latched on top of
it. It instantly killed its prey, turning it into dust.

Maybe THIS is the creature you're looking for...
.ENDMSG

