dangerous creatures notice you.

Finally, you arrive at what appears to be a nest. Many eggs lie on the
cave floor. You notice one of them is moving. You approach it, and ready
your bio-sample capture device. As the tiny creature emerges from the
egg, you manage to get it inside your sample container. This appears to
be that dangrous creature you saw before, in its infant stage.
.ENDMSG

