sure your newly captured specimen is intact.

As you enter your ship, you secure the specimen in the storage
compartment. You don't know how fast the creature grows, so you decide
the safest way of transport would be to freeze it.

You take off.

Once you exit the orbit of SR388, you start writing your mission report:
.ENDMSG

