.SCREEN	79	-

.MSG
MISSION REPORT - FILE 027991

The mission was a success. I was able to evaluate the biology of planet
SR388. The indigenous lifeforms are mostly harmless. But there's a
species that might be bio-engineered, possibly by the race that built
the colonies I found in ruins. It's possible that this is the "Metroid"
organism the Federation has been looking for months. I already notified
the rest of the teams deployed on the planet, so they can cancel their
search. I'm bringing a Metroid specimen in its infant stage to Ceres, I
can't wait to experiment with its energy manipulation properties.
Please-
.ENDMSG

